          ],
          "content": "4. Which of the following is not a planet of the Sun? (i) Jupiter (ii) Pluto (iii) Neptune (iv) Saturn"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.178,
            0.787,
